 "_readme": "The Bitcoin blocks our OpenTimestamps proofs attest to, with the merkle root each one really has. ots_verify.py grants ANCHORED only when a proof's computed root equals the root pinned here; a proof naming a block absent from this file is STRUCTURAL and is never authority.",
